gments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の元上官で、ノーデンフェルト海軍初の女性潜水艦艦長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その鬼のように厳しく容赦ない鍛え方と、部下思いで理想的な風格から、アルルも敬意と憧れを抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は、彼女が“ウルディアーナ”の艦長になる予定だったらしいが……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ほほぅ、すっかり青臭さが抜けたな。立派な成長ぶりじゃないか」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"139423"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d871b5cbaf3ea43466f70d336f7c34c45cba8a990d9f68a0932c9bf2f6abef5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/880e4406b4cac502e561ad6efb871307353fab69bfa6770a9f532def9364bf8f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白井うさぎ","creatorId":"vndb:s3002","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3002","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3002","name":"白井 うさぎ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:17445:139423:26282:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c35713","characterName":"スティア・ノール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"139416","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"17445"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18856"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35713"},"originalCharacterName":"スティア・ノール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Second-in-command of the submarine Uldiana. A soft-spoken, calm character with a gentle demeanor who quietly supports her superior when he needs it the most, both as a professional officer and a close confidant."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35713"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"若いながらも腕が立ち、アアルに忠実で頼りになる副艦長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情の起伏に乏しく、また鈍感なのか疎いだけなのか、汗が滲み、服越しに透けた豊満な胸（普段からブラ未着衣）を見られても全く気にしない、天然系な女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私